Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.79,0:00:13.00,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Yay! We're in the same class again!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:16.67,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Yuck. Minoshima's my homeroom teacher? This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:22.30,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnHandwritten Crystal v2\fs72\frz8.848\pos(1051.5,625.5)\c&H2D2E2C&}Furukawa    Nagisa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:24.59,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,3-D...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:27.01,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,Good morning, Furukawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:30.26,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Kimura-san. Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.31,0:00:33.81,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,Looks like we're in different classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.81,0:00:35.98,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,So you're in class D...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:39.40,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,Do you see anyone we were with last year?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:41.69,Default,Nog,0,0,0,,No one among the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.03,0:00:43.07,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:45.95,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll make new friends soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.95,0:00:47.66,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,You're cute, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.07,0:00:51.37,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I-I don't think that's true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.37,0:00:56.29,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,Don't be so shy and go talk to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.29,0:00:58.71,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,I'm in class A, so see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.38,0:01:00.25,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.18,0:01:09.26,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.26,0:01:10.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
