Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.14,0:02:36.90,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf24}a{\kf23}ri{\kf20}fu{\kf23}re{\kf19}ta {\kf18}mo{\kf21}no {\kf21}da{\kf29}ke{\kf40}do
