Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.57,0:02:52.57,Note,,0,0,0,,Sign: Welcome New Students
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.87,0:02:59.37,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Why is this the first thing we do as juniors?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.37,0:03:02.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's because we screwed up escaping from class.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.55,0:03:07.63,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.38,0:03:13.84,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I can't take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.60,0:03:17.06,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I'm the one who can't take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.06,0:03:20.93,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Why the heck do I have to keep my eyes on you guys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:23.15,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You should have just let us go, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.15,0:03:26.19,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,We're here because you turned us-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.52,0:03:29.57,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,That's called undue resentment!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.57,0:03:34.62,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,If you don't know the term, want me to crack open your skull and hammer it into your brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.62,0:03:35.99,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Your eyes are serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.58,0:03:41.00,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,This is why I didn't want to accept being the class representative!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.00,0:03:43.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then let's finish this and go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.83,0:03:46.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,None of us want to waste time doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.71,0:03:48.50,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What was your name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.05,0:03:50.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okazaki Tomoya. {ep 22}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.71,0:03:51.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's yours? {ep 22}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.51,0:03:54.09,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I don't have a name to give delinquents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.64,0:03:58.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I said my name, so you tell yours, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.31,0:04:01.35,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Never. I don't want to acquaint myself with idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.35,0:04:03.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You have a wonderful personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.73,0:04:06.81,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Hey, looks like you have an eye for people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.81,0:04:10.03,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Do you at least want permission to talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.03,0:04:11.57,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,There you go again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.32,0:04:14.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.12,0:04:22.50,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,H-Hey, keep off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.50,0:04:24.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I saved you, and you're giving me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.17,0:04:28.38,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm not all right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.71,0:04:32.38,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Extra Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.71,0:04:32.38,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}Events from One Year Ago
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.47,0:04:37.76,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It's iffy whether you deserve a word of gratitude or not, but I'll give you my thanks this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.76,0:04:39.76,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You'd better be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.68,0:04:42.64,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I'm Fujibayashi Kyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:46.56,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I'll be with you guys for a year,\Nbut don't give me too much trouble, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:47.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Fujibayashi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.98,0:04:50.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There was another Fujibayashi in the next class over, wasn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.73,0:04:52.23,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,That's my twin sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.78,0:04:55.70,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It's confusing, so just call me Kyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.28,0:04:56.86,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.07,0:05:00.95,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,We got to know a strange girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:03.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I bet she's thinking the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.58,0:05:06.04,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey, what should we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:07.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's hang out by the train station.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.96,0:05:10.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We've got nothing else to do, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.29,0:05:11.25,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.17,0:05:15.51,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.51,0:05:17.01,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey, welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.01,0:05:19.01,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,How's the new class?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.26,0:05:23.39,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I couldn't talk with anyone, so I was a little lonely. {ep 22}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.31,0:05:26.27,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Why don't you just dive in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.27,0:05:28.06,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Go introduce yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.06,0:05:31.02,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,"Hello? Yeah, it's me. Me."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:33.73,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,"Ah? I'm Nagisa, your granddaughter."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.73,0:05:35.90,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,"I got in an accident, and I'm in a little trouble..."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:38.24,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Do at least something like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.24,0:05:40.16,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,That's a little different.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.16,0:05:43.29,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm saying you need a determination on that level.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.29,0:05:45.87,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Be proactive! Proactive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.87,0:05:50.92,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Even as a junior, it took me a lot of time to become friends with my classmates. {ep 22}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:52.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It looks like it'll take time this time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.75,0:05:55.17,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,All it takes is a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.17,0:05:59.72,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Everyone around you wants to make friends fast, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.39,0:06:01.80,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:02.85,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Chance it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.31,0:06:06.02,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,All right. I'll teach you a special trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:10.98,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You know how embarrassing it is to call your teacher "mother" by mistake, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.98,0:06:15.28,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You adapt that and call the teacher, "Mother of Ultra"!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.23,0:06:18.78,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Then a rumor starts to go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:21.95,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,"Could Furukawa-san be related to the Ultramen?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.95,0:06:23.74,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,"I wonder if she can transform."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.74,0:06:25.20,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,"Let's ask her."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:28.75,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,"Hey, Furukawa-san, do you want to eat lunch together?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.75,0:06:31.71,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I think that's too difficult to accomplish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.71,0:06:34.92,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Then how about sharing this with the class?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:36.96,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mom's bread?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.96,0:06:41.01,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,There must be someone willing to suffer through eating this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.01,0:06:44.05,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Talk to kind people like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.39,0:06:47.10,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Though, I think that's {\i1}too{\i0} much to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.10,0:06:49.73,Default,San,0,0,0,,So my bread was... my bread was...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.31,0:06:54.31,Default,San,0,0,0,,...too much to ask for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.31,0:06:55.40,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.40,0:06:57.40,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,...love them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:06.16,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,I'll now explain tomorrow's entrance ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:09.50,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,First, the juniors and seniors will sit in the gym,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:12.50,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,then the freshmen will enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:16.09,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,After the ceremony, freshmen have orientation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.09,0:07:19.34,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Juniors and seniors will start their classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.01,0:07:21.51,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,The freshmen will-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.88,0:07:23.39,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mother of Ultra!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.39,0:07:25.14,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I have a question!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.14,0:07:27.51,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Furukawa-san, you're related to the Ultramen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.51,0:07:29.22,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:30.35,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Can you show us your transformation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.73,0:07:34.19,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Oh, I made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.19,0:07:36.36,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sorry for being so clumsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.98,0:07:43.61,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Make sure you don't scare them by recruiting for clubs too aggressively.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.49,0:07:49.74,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Also, refrain from doing welcome events other than those organized by the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.55,0:07:59.88,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,This guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:02.17,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Wake up, Okazaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.17,0:08:04.13,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Fifth period's about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.59,0:08:05.64,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,God...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.39,0:08:11.77,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I guess he belongs to the cool-looking side,\Nnow that I take a close look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.31,0:08:15.40,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I wonder if he has a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:20.65,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okazaki, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:24.99,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Su-Sunohara. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.99,0:08:26.70,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What were {\i1}you{\i0} doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.70,0:08:30.08,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Were you trying to kill him while he's asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.08,0:08:34.66,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Or, were you trying to screw around with him in the guy-girl relationship sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:36.63,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:39.42,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.42,0:08:43.47,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Weren't you thinking something like, "Hey, he's pretty good looking"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.76,0:08:45.80,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,He looks like a total retard, but he's pretty sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.80,0:08:48.64,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,A punch erases memory, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:50.06,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Where is this coming from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.85,0:08:53.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Shut up! What's with the commotion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.93,0:08:54.68,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okazaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:56.81,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You were in danger, you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.81,0:08:59.36,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You were about to be in a guy-girl rela-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.19,0:09:04.28,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Erasing memory, accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.24,0:09:10.78,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,Furukawa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.70,0:09:13.95,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Kimura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:16.29,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,Finally caught up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.62,0:09:18.38,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,Are you by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.38,0:09:19.21,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.21,0:09:23.13,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,I got to know her in my new class.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.13,0:09:26.55,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,We're going to go check out some clothes; do you want to come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.13,0:09:28.80,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.80,0:09:32.06,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,Furukawa-san's a really funny person, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.06,0:09:33.10,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:36.14,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But it's not good to linger on the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.14,0:09:39.40,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,No one cares about that kind of stuff nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.40,0:09:40.48,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,Here, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.90,0:09:47.28,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,It looks cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.49,0:09:51.07,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,She's right. You look nice, Furukawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.45,0:09:53.45,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm so nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.12,0:09:57.41,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,If a teacher finds us, we'll get yelled at.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.41,0:09:59.42,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,Next, try this dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.42,0:10:00.54,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.71,0:10:08.09,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,Oh no, Furukawa-san! A teacher's on patrol here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.93,0:10:11.30,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,We're going to make our run, so good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.89,0:10:14.64,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please wait! Please don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.64,0:10:18.23,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I... Even if you wish me luck...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.81,0:10:20.81,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.94,0:10:24.90,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.99,0:10:30.61,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,We're sorry about that.\NYou were so funny, we couldn't resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.61,0:10:34.08,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's fine. Though it scared me a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.08,0:10:36.24,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,Such a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.24,0:10:40.54,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,You're such a fun person, yet nobody realizes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.54,0:10:43.67,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,It'll be nice if you can make friends in your class soon. {ep 22}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.67,0:10:44.59,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. {ep 22}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.59,0:10:46.13,Default,Kim,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.13,0:10:47.63,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Good bye, Furukawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:56.22,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Like that, I was with Kimura-san\Non the way home, so it was fun, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.22,0:10:58.89,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,But you're alone in the class like always. {ep 22 with little change}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.89,0:10:59.73,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.39,0:11:06.15,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Thirty people packed in a small class, so there ought to be at least one person you can get along with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.15,0:11:13.82,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Even among those you pass in the hallway may be a friend forever or your soulmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.37,0:11:17.66,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,But without action, they're forever no one to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.33,0:11:19.95,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,How should I take action?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.95,0:11:22.37,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,This comes into action!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.37,0:11:25.54,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Bread made by Sanae is mixed in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.54,0:11:29.34,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Give this to the class and enjoy the surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.09,0:11:32.93,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Same as those pranks you see at parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.93,0:11:35.14,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It's bound to start a conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.14,0:11:38.14,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,"Furukawa-san, you come up with the funniest ideas."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.14,0:11:40.02,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,"I want to be friends with you."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.02,0:11:41.06,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.69,0:11:45.81,Default,San,0,0,0,,So my bread was... my bread was...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.81,0:11:49.86,Default,San,0,0,0,,...something meant to be enjoyed as a surprise?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.86,0:11:51.36,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.90,0:11:54.70,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,...love them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.74,0:12:00.79,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Six of Spades and Eight of Hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.79,0:12:02.71,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,And, Nine of Spades.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.71,0:12:06.71,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,"6" and "9" come together and make the shape of "8", so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.34,0:12:11.51,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Your fortune-telling method's completely original as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.51,0:12:14.72,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Onee-chan, you'll be asked out by someone tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.72,0:12:16.22,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Asked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.22,0:12:18.51,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,The person will say, "I like you".
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.51,0:12:20.47,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,From some nice boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.14,0:12:28.98,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I think we need to let her know how terrifying we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.98,0:12:31.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What? Going to pick a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.15,0:12:33.07,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,We're taking a much smarter path!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.99,0:12:36.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"Dear Fujibayashi Kyou-sama."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.87,0:12:40.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"I fell in love with you the other day\Nand want to confess my love for you,"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.58,0:12:43.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"so please come to the reference room in the old building during lunch."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.75,0:12:45.17,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"See you there."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.08,0:12:49.29,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,We're going to put that in her shoe locker tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.63,0:12:53.47,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,When her heart's pounding and all,\Nwe'll watch her and laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.47,0:12:57.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This is my first time seeing a love letter with "I'm stupid" written all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.05,0:13:00.43,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,With this, Fujibayashi Kyou will be shocked and won't be able to stand tall again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.43,0:13:04.23,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,We'll be able to enjoy the rest of the year!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.23,0:13:08.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,True, a terror will be waiting. In many ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.86,0:13:09.56,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.32,0:13:13.23,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I can't wait for tomorrow to come.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.36,0:13:16.15,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(750,700)}Sign: Entrance Ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.57,0:13:18.32,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)}Sign: Welcome New Students
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.03,0:13:22.37,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I'm the person on duty, so I'm going to head up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.37,0:13:24.00,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Yeah, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:32.92,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,"Dear Fujibayashi Kyou-sama."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.34,0:13:36.97,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,No way! Ryou's fortune-telling's right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.47,0:13:42.35,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Look at her blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.35,0:13:43.81,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,She can be pretty cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.81,0:13:46.48,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I think we're doing something really sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.48,0:13:53.53,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Look, look, that boy's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.53,0:13:56.24,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,What? You're setting targets now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:58.28,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I wonder how many we'll get into our club.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.28,0:14:02.12,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Yeah. It'd be nice if we could get at least two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.03,0:14:00.74,Default-alt,Nag,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.12,0:14:03.70,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Look, he's well-built.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.99,0:14:08.50,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Hey, that boy with the round face. Doesn't he resemble that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.50,0:14:11.50,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,You know, that thing that was popular a few years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.50,0:14:13.00,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,The mascot character.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:15.17,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,What was it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:18.13,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.13,0:14:20.22,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Ah, what was it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:21.93,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I can't remember it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.93,0:14:25.77,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,It was pretty popular, wasn't it?\NWith lots of dolls and such getting sold?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.77,0:14:27.02,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.02,0:14:30.02,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,All right, we're going to the gym now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.03,0:14:40.99,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,600)}Sign: Hikarizaka Private School Entrance Ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:47.16,Default,HM,0,0,0,,New students, I hope you will have three wonderful years here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.75,0:14:52.46,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Next, salutation from the new students.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.89,0:15:10.52,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Hey, am I actually looking forward to meeting the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.52,0:15:12.02,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\fs72\b1\frz348.498\frx10\fry8\pos(859.5,613.5)\c&H535956&}Reference Room
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:31.87,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,"There has been a little mishap. Please come to the rooftop."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.88,0:15:45.01,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,"I'm sorry. Please come to the gym storage room after all."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.51,0:15:48.56,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What is this guy thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.68,0:15:54.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You'd better quit it soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.40,0:15:58.11,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Why? You can't find something this funny that often.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.98,0:16:00.86,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mother of Ultra.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.86,0:16:02.82,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mother of Ultra.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.08,0:16:13.92,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Wow. She still doesn't realize she's being messed with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.92,0:16:15.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's quit it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:17.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's gone too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.38,0:16:18.92,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,This is only the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:21.51,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Got to get ahead of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.64,0:16:29.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You better make this {\i1}it{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.01,0:16:30.52,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.52,0:16:35.14,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,There has been another mishap, so this time-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.14,0:16:37.15,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Where should I make her go this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.15,0:16:39.82,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,How about, "I'll be waiting for you in Hell"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.82,0:16:40.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.65,0:16:42.61,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey, nice idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.61,0:16:44.36,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I like that scary sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:46.86,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I'm glad it's to your liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.75,0:16:57.83,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I thought I was really getting sent to Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.29,0:17:01.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So, why are we doing something like this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.96,0:17:06.43,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,We're going to trick the freshmen to unwind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.43,0:17:07.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Taking it out on others?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.84,0:17:09.35,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnThrow My Hands Up in the Air\fs90\b1\c&H989898&\pos(913.5,310.5)\frz345.011\blur1}Pull me\N please
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.84,0:17:09.35,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnThrow My Hands Up in the Air\fs90\b1\c&H989898&\frz347.421\pos(886.5,975)\blur1}It'll be fun
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:12.22,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What should I write?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.35,0:17:16.60,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,"Sunohara, Okazaki, the friendly team. By Howdy." {leave it messy}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.60,0:17:17.77,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,How's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.77,0:17:21.82,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,We'll use difficult kanji to write howdy like punks do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:24.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There were several things I could point out, but nonetheless, won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:28.99,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Then, "Youhei-Tomoya, the best. By Howdy."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.99,0:17:31.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So you know, "by" goes before the names.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.53,0:17:40.71,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,In that case, "Sunohara-Okazaki, the friendly Euro extreme ironing team, featuring the Hikarizaka Bros. By Howdy."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.71,0:17:42.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's sounds stuffy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.46,0:17:44.96,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Then you write it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.72,0:17:48.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,When this breaks, that falls out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.72,0:17:53.47,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yeah. We're going to drill into them that high school life's not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:57.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then this is the best bit of advice I can give them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.06,0:18:03.90,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(920,400)}Sign: Welcome New Students
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.73,0:18:03.36,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.65,0:18:05.74,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,It's too suspicious, no matter how you look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.74,0:18:07.45,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Why don't you pull it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.45,0:18:10.49,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,No way. I don't want to get soaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:14.79,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,No one's falling for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.79,0:18:17.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Only a moron falls for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.66,0:18:21.67,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Damn it. You mean they're smarter than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.67,0:18:23.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Heck, you're the lowest of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.05,0:18:25.84,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.72,0:18:31.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Is she a freshman?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.10,0:18:35.14,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,The collar's blue, so she must be a senior.
