Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.06,0:19:24.94,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Oh no. She's knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.94,0:19:26.98,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Health center! Take her to the health center!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.44,0:19:29.11,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey, Okazaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.11,0:19:31.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, there was a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.36,0:19:33.36,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs63\b1\an9\frx18\fry350\frz17.145\pos(1195.5,219)\c&H0C3C6C&}Health Center
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.12,0:19:39.04,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Furukawa-san, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.33,0:19:42.50,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. But my head still hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.88,0:19:47.80,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,It was someone's prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.80,0:19:49.88,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I was right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.88,0:19:52.30,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,It was like a scene from the Drifters, and I laughed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.88,0:19:52.30,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: The Drifters is an old comedy group who used the falling metal tub routine often
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.13,0:19:53.89,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.72,0:19:56.68,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm completely fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.68,0:20:00.64,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I've wanted to have a chat with you for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:04.90,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I heard from Kimura-san that you're a nice person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.90,0:20:06.90,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,From Kimura-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.27,0:20:11.03,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I'm happy that I finally have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.40,0:20:14.16,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Could you be my friend if that's all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.82,0:20:17.66,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes! But I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.92,0:20:27.67,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Me, too. Let's be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:29.55,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Great, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.51,0:20:41.02,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Could being a kindergarten teacher be as tiring as this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.02,0:20:42.81,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.48,0:20:46.23,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,There's a pain in my class that causes nothing but trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.23,0:20:48.52,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Every day is a workout.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.52,0:20:52.36,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,But you don't look like you mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.07,0:20:55.91,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess I don't mind it much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.03,0:20:59.53,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Hey, haven't your breasts grown again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.54,0:21:08.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What are you doing this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.54,0:21:11.17,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Love Letter Mission 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.55,0:21:17.05,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,This time, I'm pretending to be a freshman falling in love at first sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.60,0:21:22.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We have so much time to waste, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.73,0:21:28.77,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It was my first time talking to her,\Nso I was a little nervous. {ep 22}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.77,0:21:32.02,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But she was a very kind and fun person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.02,0:21:34.03,Default,San,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.03,0:21:37.03,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. But it's thanks to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.53,0:21:39.66,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,That's what was in the banner ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.66,0:21:43.12,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. I kept it as a memento.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.12,0:21:47.16,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Thanks to this, I was able to muster the courage to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.50,0:21:51.59,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,"Don't lose to the obstacles you'll face."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.63,0:21:58.63,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, person with kanji too hard to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.85,0:22:09.81,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\bord0.75\3c&H000000&\blur0.5\pos(1594.5,840)}The End
